# Text files keep LF line ends in the repository.
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.cs text diff=csharp
*.asmdef text
*.md text

# Unity YAML files (scenes, prefabs, assets) stay text. A merge of a scene by hand is difficult: keep generated
# scenes out of Git when you can, and give each scene one owner (docs/file-ownership.md). For merges, you can set up
# UnityYAMLMerge (Smart Merge) of the Unity install as a merge tool.

# Git LFS: remove the "#" from the lines that you need, after "git lfs install".
# *.fbx filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
